      "notes": "Rigged humanoid for rigging / skin weights / animation / hotbox scenes. characterMedium.fbx: 1 skinned mesh (1604 tris, 32 vertex groups, Armature modifier), armature 'Root' 58 bones incl. fingers and IK/ctrl bones. Animations in separate FBX (idle 33 f, run 17 f, jump 13 f), 45 animated bones, all names match the model armature. 4 skins (Skins/*.png: criminalMaleA, cyborgFemaleA, skaterFemaleA, skaterMaleA); the FBX material has no texture and imports with Alpha 0: connect a skin PNG and set Alpha 1 in the scene (file itself unmodified). Imports ~3.76 units tall (FBX cm scale): scale to taste."
